            <fr:title text="The Quantified Me: 2026-W30"><fr:link href="/G944/" title="The Quantified Me" uri="https://kellenkanarios.com/G944/" display-uri="G944" type="local">The Quantified Me</fr:link>: 2026-W30</fr:title>
          </fr:frontmatter>
          <fr:mainmatter>
            <html:p>Another week of note-taking / learning. I wrote a little blog on the <fr:link href="/F3T0/" title="Forward-backward algorithm" uri="https://kellenkanarios.com/F3T0/" display-uri="F3T0" type="local">Forward-backward algorithm</fr:link> as part of a long overdo <fr:link href="/005G/" title="Papers of a week" uri="https://kellenkanarios.com/005G/" display-uri="005G" type="local">POTW</fr:link> on <fr:link href="/ZUAG/" title="POTW: Multi-Level Discovery of Deep Options" uri="https://kellenkanarios.com/ZUAG/" display-uri="ZUAG" type="local">DDO</fr:link>. Also did a brief write-up on <fr:link href="/G27U/" title="POTW: Learning Options via Compression" uri="https://kellenkanarios.com/G27U/" display-uri="G27U" type="local">LOVE</fr:link> that I might come back to at some point.</html:p>
            <html:figure><html:img width="100%" src="/bafkrmibvrid4rmbz67usa2imsrruu7fs5sfiuadrl3vecw3l4yhrmmftba.png" />
  <html:figcaption>Coding hours for week 2026-W30.</html:figcaption></html:figure>
            <html:p>It seems like brain-rotting is no longer a problem for me. I do not have any social media accounts remaining so there is not much for me to watch. The study time is down bit because I have done a poor job expanding my Anki deck but a great job staying on top of it.</html:p>
            <html:figure><html:img width="100%" src="/bafkrmibzhvch4ny4r4eg5e5eklor45wsh2xltqj2d2xbke5tyz6kcdwyu4.png" />
  <html:figcaption>Non-coding computer time for week 2026-W30.</html:figcaption></html:figure>
          </fr:mainmatter>
